      "value": "I think you should file a bug report about the lack of clear error message for when you can't join an instance.\n\nPersonally my only interaction with group public is I joined one for idle home a few months ago, and group public was selected as instance by default so I could not throw down a portal, other than that they're pretty easy to avoid.\n\nI think recognizing clique behavior is important life skill.",
