      "value": "@{63cbea337d46b409827e402a|full_name}: if you're going to rules lawyer VRChat on what they're saying, the groups system isn't created or maintained by world creators, the groups system is actually part of VRChat. \n\nIn fact I've seen a feature request by a world author asking that group publics be disabled if requested by a world author.\n\nVRChat is either working on groups, or hiding thier heads in the sand. I had a tab open on the groups section of this canny, and earlier this week it asked for a VRChat.com email address to verify access. I don't have one, obviously, so I closed the tab.",
