      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While most groups in VRChat are tied to a friend group or aesthetic, some  groups exist with a mission that needs public exposure either for recruitment or interaction, for example the needs of the language exchange groups. \n\n-I agree that better notification should be viewable so persons may know the terms of their ban.\n\nThe resolution of these issues should be handled by the community. Considering relying on enough of the group vouching for you, instead of appeals to authority to restrict public spaces ☮",
