      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Group Public instances are moderated by the owning group. If you don't want to be be in that group's instance, or they don't want you there, you should just go to another instance. Why is that not an option for you?\n\nIf you want a normal Public instance where there is no moderation, then join the normal Public instances instead or make a new normal Public instance.\n\nOr you can make your own group and then use it to make your own Group Public instances where you can moderate them however you want.\n\nThe beauty of VRChat's current system is that you aren't forced to be in an instance if you don't want to be. And you can easily make your own instance if you want. You can join the instance that has the level of moderation that you want.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
