      "value": "i agree with this but i feel it should have some wiggle room like:\n\n1. author choosing what powers group public instances have (eg. forcing kicking to be done after a set amount of warnings so people start using that instead of just \"oh you did something i dont like its time to instantly kick you instead of asking you to not do that anymore!\")\n\n2. author choosing to enable or disable group public instances for people who've not been whitelisted to create them\n\n3. author should be allowed to shutdown instances from the website (its their own world they should have equal if not slightly more power over instances rather then 5+ bad actors being control freaks.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
